{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0160-intersection-of-two-linked-lists","title":"LeetCode 160 相交链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0160-intersection-of-two-linked-lists","wordCount":715,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-160-相交链表\">LeetCode 160 相交链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你两个单链表的头节点 <code>headA</code> 和 <code>headB</code>，请你找出并返回两个单链表相交的起始节点。如果两个链表不存在相交节点，返回 <code>null</code>。</p>\n<p>题目数据保证整个链式结构中不存在环。注意，函数返回结果后，链表必须保持其原始结构。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>listA</code> 中节点数目为 <code>m</code></li>\n<li><code>listB</code> 中节点数目为 <code>n</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 3 × 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10⁵</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= skipA &lt; m</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= skipB &lt; n</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>listA</code> 和 <code>listB</code> 没有交点，<code>intersectVal</code> 为 0</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：listA = [4,1,8,4,5], listB = [5,6,1,8,4,5], skipA = 2, skipB = 3&#10;输出：节点值为 8 的节点&#10;解释：相交节点的值为 8，从各自链表的头部开始，链表 A 为 [4,1,8,4,5]，链表 B 为 [5,6,1,8,4,5]。在 A 中，相交节点前有 2 个节点；在 B 中，相交节点前有 3 个节点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：listA = [4,1,8,4,5], listB = [5,6,1,8,4,5], skipA = 2, skipB = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：节点值为 8 的节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：相交节点的值为 8，从各自链表的头部开始，链表 A 为 [4,1,8,4,5]，链表 B 为 [5,6,1,8,4,5]。在 A 中，相交节点前有 2 个节点；在 B 中，相交节点前有 3 个节点</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：listA = [2,6,4], listB = [1,5], skipA = 3, skipB = 2&#10;输出：null&#10;解释：两个链表不相交\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：listA = [2,6,4], listB = [1,5], skipA = 3, skipB = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：两个链表不相交</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>这道题的精华在于<strong>如何消除两个链表的长度差</strong>，使得两个指针能同时到达相交节点。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：哈希表</strong></p>\n<p>先遍历链表 A，将所有节点存入 Set；然后遍历链表 B，第一个在 Set 中存在的节点即为交点。时间 O(m+n)，空间 O(m)。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：双指针（浪漫相遇法）</strong></p>\n<p>这个解法堪称 LeetCode 中最优雅的算法之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>指针 <code>pA</code> 从链表 A 头部出发，指针 <code>pB</code> 从链表 B 头部出发</li>\n<li>当 <code>pA</code> 到达链表 A 末尾时，转向链表 B 的头部继续遍历</li>\n<li>当 <code>pB</code> 到达链表 B 末尾时，转向链表 A 的头部继续遍历</li>\n<li>如果两个链表相交，<code>pA</code> 和 <code>pB</code> 一定会在交点相遇</li>\n<li>如果不相交，两者会同时到达 <code>null</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么一定会相遇？</strong> 设链表 A 独有部分长度为 a，链表 B 独有部分长度为 b，公共部分长度为 c。<code>pA</code> 走的路径是 <code>a + c + b</code>，<code>pB</code> 走的路径是 <code>b + c + a</code>。两者总长相等，因此会同时到达交点（或同时到达 <code>null</code>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(m)</td>\n<td>直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双指针</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>空间最优，算法优雅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算长度差</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>思路直接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：双指针（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function getIntersectionNode(headA: ListNode | null, headB: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  let pA = headA;&#10;  let pB = headB;&#10;&#10;  while (pA !== pB) {&#10;    pA = pA === null ? headB : pA.next;&#10;    pB = pB === null ? headA : pB.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return pA;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getIntersectionNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码简洁到令人惊叹。当两个链表不相交时，两个指针各自走完 <code>a + c + b + c</code> 和 <code>b + c + a + c</code> 的路径后，都会到达 <code>null</code>，此时 <code>pA === pB === null</code>，循环结束。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：计算长度差</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function getIntersectionNodeByLength(headA: ListNode | null, headB: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  let lenA = 0;&#10;  let lenB = 0;&#10;  let pA = headA;&#10;  let pB = headB;&#10;&#10;  while (pA !== null) {&#10;    lenA++;&#10;    pA = pA.next;&#10;  }&#10;  while (pB !== null) {&#10;    lenB++;&#10;    pB = pB.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  pA = headA;&#10;  pB = headB;&#10;&#10;  if (lenA &gt; lenB) {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; lenA - lenB; i++) pA = pA!.next;&#10;  } else {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; lenB - lenA; i++) pB = pB!.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  while (pA !== pB) {&#10;    pA = pA!.next;&#10;    pB = pB!.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return pA;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getIntersectionNodeByLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lenA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lenB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lenA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"col