;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) pB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>方法二的思路更直观：先让较长的链表指针提前走 <code>|lenA - lenB|</code> 步，然后两个指针同步前进，第一次相遇的位置就是交点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双指针</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>每个指针最多走 m + n 步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算长度差</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>两次遍历求长度 + 一次同步遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(m)</td>\n<td>存储链表 A 的所有节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双指针解法的核心洞见是：通过让两个指针各自遍历两条链表，自动消除了长度差。这种&quot;互相走对方的路&quot;的浪漫思想，在面试中如果能清晰地解释其数学原理（<code>a + c + b = b + c + a</code>），会非常加分。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 160 相交链表","id":"leetcode-160-相交链表"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 141 环形链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0141-linked-list-cycle"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 206 反转链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0206-reverse-linked-list"}}